--- a/ROMFS/px4fmu_common/init.d-posix/airframes/2517_gz_cloudship_am_fin_drag
+++ b/ROMFS/px4fmu_common/init.d-posix/airframes/2517_gz_cloudship_am_fin_drag
 . ${R}etc/init.d-posix/airframes/2510_gz_cloudship
+
+param set-default AS_YAWRATE_FF 0.05
   (0.05 is the value with every check decided; 0.1 leaves the Acro peak within
   0.15 deg/s of 1.4 sp, 0 leaves the Stabilized release settle time undecided)

2520 and 2510 (no aerodynamic damping in the plant) keep the default 0.
Untested variants would take their own value from their damping (analytic,
hull + broadside fins, at 6.67 deg/s): 2521 vectored drag ~0.52, 2524
vectored am 0, 2526 vectored am_fin ~0.21-0.42, 2511 cloudship drag ~0.13,
2512/2516 cloudship fin ~0.01-0.03, 2514 cloudship am 0.
